{"suttaId":"tha-ap299","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[8979,8994],"vripara":"31"},"segments":{"tha-ap299:0.3":"Desakittakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap299:1.1":"“Upasālakanāmohaṃ, ahosiṃ brāhmaṇo tadā;","tha-ap299:1.3":"Kānanaṃ vanamogāḷhaṃ, lokajeṭṭhaṃ narāsabhaṃ.","tha-ap299:2.1":"“Disvāna vandiṃ pādesu, lokāhutipaṭiggahaṃ;","tha-ap299:2.3":"Pasannacittaṃ maṃ ñatvā, buddho antaradhāyatha.","tha-ap299:3.1":"“Kānanā abhinikkhamma, buddhaseṭṭhamanussariṃ;","tha-ap299:3.3":"Taṃ desaṃ kittayitvāna, kappaṃ saggamhi modahaṃ.","tha-ap299:4.1":"“Dvenavute ito kappe, yaṃ desamabhikittayiṃ;","tha-ap299:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, kittanāya idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap299:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap299:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā desakittako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap299:7.1":"Desakittakattherassāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
